- destination_node_occupied destination_node_alpha: load_destination_payload sets occupied true; unload does not remove it. So true.

- destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha: activate_destination_node sets ready true; unload adds ready (already true). So true.

- dispatch_allocated destination_availability_alpha: from allocate destination slot.

- dispatch_allocated origin_availability_alpha: from allocate origin slot.

- dispatch_ready destination_availability_alpha: from mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready (we did).

- dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha: from mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready.

- dispatched origin_availability_alpha: from execute_origin_dispatch.

- origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha: from lock_origin_availability (sets confirmed) and unload_origin_payload also sets confirmed (but lock already). So true.

- origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha: lock sets locked true; load sets locked true; unload does not affect. So true.

- origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha: load_origin_payload sets occupied true; unload does not remove. So true.

- origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha: activate_origin_node sets ready true; unload adds ready (already true). So true.

- transport_leg_assembled transport_leg_alpha: from assemble_transport_leg.

- transport_leg_destination_linked transport_leg_alpha destination_node_alpha: from assemble.

- transport_leg_loading_authorized transport_leg_alpha: from authorize.

- transport_leg_origin_linked transport_leg_alpha origin_node_alpha: from assemble.

- vehicle_available vehicle_unit_alpha: from execute_origin_dispatch effect.

