But we need origin prepared etc later.

But we also need origin prepared (candidate_prepared) which requires task profile linked to origin. So we need to link origin at some point before its prepare.

Thus we could:

1. Detach destination link (free route_task_profile)
2. Attach to origin
3. Prepare origin (confirm_candidate_preparedness)
4. Activate origin node
5. Load origin payload
6. Unload origin payload
Now origin has linked task profile (still linked) and we have origin ready, occupied, locked, confirmed.

Now we need to do destination side. We need to detach origin link to free route_task_profile for destination.

7. Detach origin link
8. Attach to destination
Now destination linked.

But we need destination prepared? It already is prepared from init (candidate_prepared destination_availability_alpha true). Good.

We also need candidate_task_profile_linked destination for activate and unload (we just attached). Good.

Now we need to activate destination node, load destination payload, unload destination payload.

