After activate, destination node ready.

Load destination payload: requires candidate_prepared destination (true), destination_availability_node_linked (true), cargo_available (we have cargo available after origin unload), not destination_availability_locked (currently false). Good.

After load, destination_node_occupied true, destination_availability_locked true, cargo unavailable.

Unload destination payload: requires candidate_prepared destination (true), candidate_task_profile_linked destination (true), destination_availability_node_linked (true), destination_node_occupied true, destination_payload_linked true, not destination_availability_confirmed (currently false). Effect: destination_node_ready true (adds), destination_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true, not destination_payload_linked. Leaves destination_node_occupied true, destination_availability_locked true.

Thus after destination unload, we have destination node occupied and ready, availability locked and confirmed, cargo available.

Now we have both origin and destination sides ready.

Now we need transport leg assembled: need origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available.

We have all true.

Now we need to authorize transport leg loading: requires transport_leg_assembled, origin_availability_locked, candidate_task_profile_linked origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha, not transport_leg_loading_authorized.

At this point, origin_availability_alpha currently does NOT have task profile linked (we detached it in step 7). So we need to link origin again for authorize. We'll need to detach destination link and attach origin link.

Thus after destination unload, we have destination linked. We'll detach destination link, attach origin link.

Then authorize.

After authorize, we need to mark origin and destination dispatch ready. Those do not require task profile linked.

